Contribution City includes adapted portions of Git City by Samuel Rizzon:
https://github.com/srizzon/git-city

Git City is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.
The complete license is in LICENSE. This adaptation is AGPL-3.0-only.
The application footer offers its complete source archive at /source.zip.

Adapted reference files:
- src/components/CityCanvas.tsx and FlyTune.tsx — flight and tuned camera
- src/components/IntroColdOpen.tsx — home camera pose
- src/components/SFMapLayers.tsx — geography, trees, water and ground shader
- GoldenGateBridge.tsx, BayBridge.tsx and SFLandmarks.tsx — landmarks
- src/components/city/theme.tsx — palettes and sky stops
- src/components/city/decorations.tsx — block-grid fallback props
- src/components/InstancedBuildings.tsx — instanced pixel facade approach
- src/lib/map-geometry.ts and city-sf-layout.ts — map and footprint indexing
- src/lib/city-layout-core.ts and github.ts — scores and fallback lots
- public/models/paper-plane.glb — retained paper plane

Changes include per-repository buildings, fetched authored-commit windows,
fixed-step flight and traffic, DOM controls, touch input, and queued signals.
Git City's accounts, purchases, multiplayer and services are not included.

